00:27:59.550 --> 00:28:01.860
and then have 10 screens up?

00:28:01.860 --> 00:28:06.360
Then what if we had 100
Kubernetes clusters?

00:28:06.360 --> 00:28:08.260
That doesn't scale.

00:28:08.260 --> 00:28:13.800
So we've built a custom UI that
