00:31:12.610 --> 00:31:19.890
So I once saw a
demonstration of somebody

00:31:19.890 --> 00:31:26.610
building a lot of containers
and running a lot of containers

00:31:26.610 --> 00:31:27.585
in a cluster.

00:31:27.585 --> 00:31:31.260
And that visualization
was beautiful.

00:31:31.260 --> 00:31:36.610
And it honestly looked
to me like a galaxy.

00:31:36.610 --> 00:31:45.960
So when I saw this one for
the first time at scale,

00:31:45.960 --> 00:31:52.120
I thought that each one
of these little clusters

00:31:52.120 --> 00:31:54.800
looks like a galaxy.

00:31:54.800 --> 00:32:01.480
So I made a comment
to my team, guys, I

00:32:01.480 --> 00:32:04.330
think we've inadvertently
modeled the universe.

00:32:04.330 --> 00:32:08.170
(LAUGHING)

00:32:08.170 --> 00:32:15.010
If you want to see this demo
