we don't have the answer yet.

00:34:32.429 --> 00:34:35.880
However, what I
wanted to point out

00:34:35.880 --> 00:34:39.750
is that, as in many
things in science,

00:34:39.750 --> 00:34:44.980
the answer to the question,
what is the best model, is,

00:34:44.980 --> 00:34:47.949
it depends.

00:34:47.949 --> 00:34:51.760
If you used the criteria
of root mean square error,

00:34:51.760 --> 00:34:54.489
then the answer is 1.

00:34:54.489 --> 00:34:56.989
If you used max
percentage error,

00:34:56.989 --> 00:34:58.930
then you might get
a different model--

00:34:58.930 --> 00:35:02.190
or average percentage error.

00:35:02.190 --> 00:35:06.000
