screenshots of scale.

00:35:29.680 --> 00:35:35.290
We used Docker, Kubernetes,
TensorFlow, and Kubeflow

00:35:35.290 --> 00:35:38.470
on scalable infrastructure
and managed services

00:35:38.470 --> 00:35:39.310
